The '''Howling Cave''' is a sub-location of [[The Park]].

{{ZoneText|Fight for your life against wolves from the past.}}

== Purpose ==
{{NPCSprite|Old Shaman Nyko}} is the sole [[NPC]] located in the '''Howling Cave'''. They sell two items: {{Item|True Essence}}, which can be used to brew [[True Resistance Potion]]s, and a [[Enchantments#True Protection|True Protection]] [[Enchanted Book]], which can be applied to [[Chestplate]]s to grant a small increase to {{stat|td}}.

